        sol_biometano_contexto_kicker: "Market context",
        sol_biometano_contexto_title: "Biomethane is Brazil's renewable natural gas.",
        sol_biometano_contexto_p1: "ANP Resolution <strong>854/2021</strong> established the technical specifications and regulatory framework that make biomethane marketable, directly replacing fossil natural gas in industry, transport and power generation.",
        sol_biometano_contexto_p2: "The market projects <strong>15× growth by 2030</strong> (Abiogás/EPE), with potential of <strong>70 billion m³/year</strong>, more than the country's current natural gas consumption. Under RenovaBio, producers also issue CBIOs, traded on B3, adding R$ 50 to R$ 200/tCO₂e to revenue.",
        sol_biometano_stat_pureza_label: "CH₄ purity (ANP standard)",
        sol_biometano_stat_potencial_label: "m³/year of potential in Brazil",
        sol_biometano_stat_crescimento_label: "Estimated growth by 2030",
        sol_biometano_stat_cbio_label: "Credit traded on B3",
        sol_biometano_processo_kicker: "Our solution",
        sol_biometano_processo_title: "From raw biogas to certified biomethane.",
        sol_biometano_processo_lead: "Six stages of upgrading, measurement and commercialization.",
        sol_biometano_step1_title: "Raw biogas generated at the plant",
        sol_biometano_step1_desc: "Typical composition: 55–70% CH₄, 30–45% CO₂, H₂S, moisture and traces of VOCs. This is the starting point of upgrading.",
        sol_biometano_step2_title: "Biogas pre-treatment",
        sol_biometano_step2_desc: "Desulfurization (biological or chemical), partial CO₂ removal, condensation/moisture removal and particulate filtration protect equipment and increase efficiency.",
        sol_biometano_step3_title: "Compression and upgrading",
        sol_biometano_step3_desc: "CO₂ separation by PSA (Pressure Swing Adsorption) or polymeric membranes. The technology depends on scale, purity and operating cost; both meet ANP 854/2021.",
        sol_biometano_step4_title: "Purified biomethane, laboratory analysis",
        sol_biometano_step4_desc: "Minimum 97% CH₄ according to ANP 854/2021. Periodic sampling for chromatography at an accredited laboratory, with traceable reports.",
        sol_biometano_step5_title: "Measurement, ANP certification and CBIOs",
        sol_biometano_step5_desc: "Fiscal Measurement System (SMF) approved by ANP, registration in RenovaBio and issuance of CBIOs proportional to production and carbon intensity. 1 CBIO = 1 tCO₂e.",
        sol_biometano_step6_title: "Distribution and end use",
        sol_biometano_step6_desc: "Injection into the natural gas grid · compression for CNG (vehicular) · liquefaction for LNG (long distance) · direct delivery to industrial consumers. We structure the sales contracts.",
        sol_biometano_spec_kicker: "Specifications",
        sol_biometano_spec_title: "ANP 854/2021 standard × 4WaTT technology.",
