        sol_biometano_spec_row_medicao_tech: "SMF with real-time telemetry",
        sol_biometano_cert_kicker: "Certifications & regulation",
        sol_biometano_cert_title: "The legal framework that unlocks revenue.",
        sol_biometano_cert_anp_desc: "Regulates biomethane quality specifications and requirements for producers, distributors and fiscal measurement. The market's legal framework.",
        sol_biometano_cert_renovabio_desc: "National Biofuels Policy (Law 13,576/2017). Registered producers receive the Efficient Production Certificate (EPC) and issue CBIOs.",
        sol_biometano_cert_cbio_desc: "Decarbonization Credit traded on B3. Each CBIO = 1 tonne of CO₂e avoided · additional revenue according to distributors' demand.",
